+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a 5,000-record store, the measured `SessionStart` hook cost was **11.9 ms
+p50** before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path. After that
+change, the measured cost was **1.05 ms p50**.
+
+The same change added the trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter and the
+`CHECK (length(body) <= 2000)` constraint. Read hooks now use the recorded
+`quick_check` result and `fts_rows`; the live integrity and FTS checks remain
+available outside the read path.
